<title>USA: Consolidated Natural Gas sets $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Natural Gas sets $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following putable debt issue from Consolidated Natural Gas Co was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CONSOLIDATED NATURAL GAS CO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	   COUPON 6.875 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/26</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DEBENTURES  ISS PRICE 100.875  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97 LAST MOODY A1	  YIELD 6.752 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS    SPREAD 16 BP</p>
<p>NOTES PUT OPTION 10/15/06</p>
<p>PRICED OVER 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
